node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.tgz

# 探针脚本与验证证据（约 1.6MB，本地复现用）：不入库。
# ⚠ gitignore 不影响**已跟踪**文件——tools/ 下早期提交的 8 个 probe-*.mjs 仍在版本控制中。
tools/

# lib/ is committed on purpose: `dsh plugin add github:zeng6125-rgb/dsh-usage-heatmap`
# installs straight from this repository, and scripts/build.sh needs a local DSH
# source checkout (DSH_CHECKOUT) that an end user does not have. Shipping the
# compiled output is what makes the git install work without a build step.
!lib/
